# Compiled bytecode — machine- and version-specific (cpython-314), regenerated on every run.
# Tracked, these rewrite themselves constantly: 14 of this repo's 38 dirty files were .pyc churn,
# which buries real WIP in `git status` — the one signal that keeps concurrent sessions apart.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
scripts/gh-to-nvim-key.pem
